  m_text: 'This train is a small train filled with elves headed for the north pole.However
    something is wrong the elves all seem confused.

    The train seems to never
    stop and let the elves off. How will they return to the north pole if the train
    never stops. This must

    be the work of a missing page perhaps its somewhere
    on the train. The only option now is to enter the books pages.'
